            <description><![CDATA[

        <h2>ExtraDock 5.0.1-beta.5 – Rock-Solid DockFlow Preset Switching! 🔄🛠️</h2>

        <h3>🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Docks Survive DockFlow Preset Switches:</strong> When DockFlow applies a preset that restarts the macOS Dock, ExtraDock now detects the restart reliably and repairs every dock — no more docks left attached to a stale Dock!</li>
            <li><strong>Hidden Docks Stay Hidden:</strong> A Dock restart no longer accidentally brings back docks you had hidden — and show/hide is only confirmed once the window actually reaches the requested state!</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>⚡ Improvements</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Deeper Integration Diagnostics:</strong> ExtraDock now logs Dock restarts, dock repairs, and every DockFlow request and response, making integration issues much easier to trace!</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>🚀 What's Next?</h3>
        <p>This beta continues polishing the first official V5 release — please report anything that still feels off!</p>

        <p style="margin-top: 20px;"><em>Thank you for helping test ExtraDock 5! Your feedback drives every improvement we make. 💙</em></p>
            ]]></description>

